OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #160m needed to clean up
OL,4,Aone of Europe's largest illegal dumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #160m is needed to clean up
OL,7,Fand maintain one of Europe's largest
OL,8,Fillegal landfill sites, government
OL,9,Fofficials have said.
OL,11,FThe contaminated Mobuoy dump at Campsie
OL,12,Fin County Londonderry, discovered and
OL,13,Fshut down in 2013, was used to bury
OL,14,Fthousands of tonnes of rubbish at a
OL,15,Fsite spanning more than 100 acres.
OL,17,FLast year, two businessmen were jailed
OL,18,Ffor their part in the operation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
