OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #160m needed to clean up
OL,4,Aone of Europe's largest illegal dumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's Environment Minister
OL,7,FAndrew Muir said his department had now
OL,8,Freceived an updated cost estimate of
OL,9,F#161m for the clean-up over a 30-year
OL,10,Fperiod.
